@HostAddress = http://localhost:5233

### Sign in (copy accessToken into @token below)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@creditplus.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Paste the token from the response above
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Who am I
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Users (Admin only)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit trail (Manager or Admin)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/audit?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send an email
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/emails
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAddress": "sarah@alnoor.com",
  "toName": "Sarah Haddad",
  "subject": "Your financing proposal",
  "body": "Hello Sarah, the revised terms are ready."
}

### Dashboard summary
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/crm/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Leads
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/crm/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Leads filtered
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/crm/leads?search=noor&status=Qualified
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a lead
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/crm/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nour Al Haddad",
  "company": "Noor Industries",
  "email": "nour@noorindustries.com",
  "phone": "+962 7 9000 5566",
  "source": "Referral"
}

### Deals
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/crm/deals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Deal stages
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/crm/deals/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a deal
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/crm/deals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Equipment leasing",
  "company": "Noor Industries",
  "contact": "Nour Al Haddad",
  "value": 26500,
  "stage": "Qualified",
  "probability": 45,
  "expectedCloseDate": "2026-10-15"
}

### Move a deal to another stage
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/crm/deals/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "Won"
}

### Activities
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/crm/activities?completed=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create an activity
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/crm/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Follow up on pricing",
  "type": "Call",
  "relatedTo": "Noor Industries",
  "dueAt": "2026-09-22T10:00:00+03:00"
}

### Complete an activity
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/crm/activities/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/complete

###
